#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "SM RFQ"
msgstr "SM RFQ"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid ""
"Requests for quotation: buyers describe what they need (profile rows weighed"
" by SM Weight Engine or free description, quantity, delivery place and date,"
" drawings); suppliers and manufacturers answer with a price, a price per kg "
"and a delivery time; the buyer compares the offers, contacts suppliers and "
"accepts one. Notifications in French and Arabic. Requires SM Core, SM Weight"
" Engine and SM Products."
msgstr ""
"Demandes de devis : l’acheteur décrit son besoin (profils pesés par SM "
"Weight Engine ou description libre, quantité, lieu et date de livraison, "
"plans) ; fournisseurs et fabricants répondent avec un prix, un prix au kg et"
" un délai ; l’acheteur compare les offres, contacte les fournisseurs et en "
"accepte une. Notifications en français et en arabe. Nécessite SM Core, SM "
"Weight Engine et SM Products."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

#: sm-rfq.php:47
msgid ""
"SM RFQ needs the SM Core, SM Weight Engine and SM Products plugins. Activate"
" them first."
msgstr ""
"SM RFQ nécessite les extensions SM Core, SM Weight Engine et SM Products. "
"Activez-les d’abord."

